      "content": "First, sit or lie down immediately to prevent further injury and allow blood flow to stabilize before standing again. Avoid looking directly at the bright phone screen; instead, dim the display, remove purple filters, or switch to a warmer color mode to reduce eye strain. If your dizziness persists for more than a few minutes, worsens, or is accompanied by vision changes, seek medical attention right away rather than pushing through your shift.",
