      "role": "user",
      "content": "the lights are bothering me less if i just turn the brightness way down but the dizzy feeling wont go away. i really cant afford to take time off work right now. is there like a supplement or something i can take to just snap out of it and get my focus back? maybe some ginger or something like that?",
